    "directions": [
      "Preheat the oven to 350 °F. Line a muffin pan with paper liners or butter and flour the pan. (see note)",
      "In a mixing bowl whisk together 7 ½ ounces&#32;whole wheat flour, 2 ounces&#32;wheat bran, 1 teaspoon&#32;baking powder, ½ teaspoon&#32;baking soda and ½ teaspoon&#32;table salt. Toss in 5 ounces&#32;raisins.",
      "In a separate bowl whisk together 8 ounces&#32;whole milk, 6 ounces&#32;honey, 1 ¾ ounces&#32;vegetable oil and 2&#32;large eggs. Grate 1&#32;large apple with the large side of a grater and add the grated apple to the milk mixture.",
      "Add the wet ingredients to the dry ingredients and mix just until combined. Scoop the batter into the muffin pan. Bake until the center of a muffin springs back when lightly pressed, about 15 minutes for standard size muffins."
    ],
